    "# Example: Using the Topological Lung Transplantation Mortality Prediction Model\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates how to load and use the trained model to predict 1-year mortality risk for lung transplant patients.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Contents\n",
    "1. Load required packages\n",
    "2. Load model and preprocessors\n",
    "3. Load synthetic patient data\n",
    "4. Make predictions for individual patients\n",
    "5. Interpret predictions with SHAP\n",
    "6. Batch prediction example\n",
    "7. Visualize results"
   ]
